    "enUS": {
      "description": "Dese waters be treacherous. My headhunters keep the paths clear as dey can, but there be a beasty stalkin' de rivers even we cannot catch. Excitin', eh?\r\n\r\nBoss say we gotta clear it out, so we got a little competition goin'. Find de white one patrollin' de rivers and bring me its fang. Whoever sticks this slippery crocolisk win de whole pot. Just don't get snapped yourself, heheh!\r\n\r\n-- Tan'jani",
      "dialogue": {
        "94be288b0630592f4f73": "Taz'dingo! You be a skilled hunter if ya caught ol' Ghostmaw.",
        "f6a01df6887d258540aa": "Ya look like ya seen a ghost, mon. Heheheh."
      },
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Ghostmaw's Fang",
          "type": "item"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Bring Ghostmaw's Fang to Tan'jani in Rog'mar.",
